{"id":"30209339bd5901cf","group":"90","path":"90/90-prop-essential-undecidable-implies.md","title":"Essentially Undecidable Implies","display":"prop-essential-undecidable-implies — Essentially Undecidable Implies","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-prop-essential-undecidable-implies","aliases":["90-prop-essential-undecidable-implies"],"display":"prop-essential-undecidable-implies — Essentially Undecidable Implies","depends_on":["[[90-df-essentially-undecidable]]","[[90-df-decidable-theory]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-prop-essential-undecidable-implies"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-prop-essential-undecidable-implies</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-essential-undecidable-implies — Essentially Undecidable Implies"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" href=\"?note=e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" title=\"90-df-essentially-undecidable\">90-df-essentially-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06f1ec898bae8895\" href=\"?note=06f1ec898bae8895\" title=\"90-df-decidable-theory\">90-df-decidable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span> (fixed effective signature and effective Gödel numbering)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\">\\(T,U\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}\\)</span> (essential-undecidability predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\\)</span> (effective-axiomatizability predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}\\)</span> (decidable-theory predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}essential\\text{-}undecidable\\text{-}implies}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(T)\\land T\\subseteq U\\land\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(U)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}essential\\text{-}undecidable\\text{-}implies}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(T)\\land T\\subseteq U\\land\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(U)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只对一致且可有效公理化的扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 作结论；不一致扩张的定理集反而是平凡可判定的。</li>\n<li>记号与上游定义统一为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DecTh}\">\\(\\mathrm{DecTh}\\)</span>，避免引入未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Undec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Undec}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"e3ae8bc1f7b51728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-essentially-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"06f1ec898bae8895","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-decidable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,g","display":false},{"tex":"T,U","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}essential\\text{-}undecidable\\text{-}implies}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(T)\\land T\\subseteq U\\land\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(U)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(U).","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DecTh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Undec}","display":false}],"bytes":1392,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-prop-creative-complete.md]]\n[[90-prop-essential-unde